keynet.npz holds the weights of the KeyNet model from MusicalKeyCNN
(https://github.com/a1ex90/MusicalKeyCNN), taken from checkpoints/keynet.pt in the fork
https://github.com/puppi3-music/MusicalKeyCNN-CKA (commit 37b1189) and converted to numpy by
scripts/convert_keynet.py. keycnn.py reimplements that model's input pipeline and forward pass.
Both repositories are under the MIT License below.

KeyNet's design is from F. Korzeniowski and G. Widmer, "Genre-Agnostic Key Classification with
Convolutional Neural Networks", ISMIR 2018.

